flowchart TD
  Q[Question] --> Refresh{Corpus stale?}
  Refresh -->|yes| Index[Incremental index then invalidate caches]
  Refresh -->|no| Plan
  Index --> Plan[Planner: entities, intent, first queries]
  Plan --> ReasonPlan[Reasoning: frame the question]
  ReasonPlan --> Search[search_corpus tool]
  Search --> Extract[Extract claims from hits]
  Extract --> Find[Reasoning: what this pass found]
  Find --> Critic{Gap critic}
  Critic -->|pointer or missing claim| Next[Reformulate query, raise authority filter]
  Next --> Search
  Critic -->|near-name warning| Next
  Critic -->|sufficient or budget spent| Arbitrate[Claim arbitration by tier]
  Arbitrate --> Judge[Reasoning: which source stands]
  Judge --> Dossier[Build document dossier]
  Dossier --> Brief[Heuristic Answer Why Documents How Sources]
  Brief --> Voice{Voice and fact check}
  Voice -->|LLM available and clean| Polish[LLM rewrites Answer and Why only]
  Voice -->|fail or offline| Keep[Keep heuristic brief]
  Polish --> Out[Stream answer_chunk then final answer]
  Keep --> Out
